      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，她每天努力进行着各种蜘蛛练习。\n是什么驱使她做到如此地步呢……\n这天，她同样也在镜子前练习姿势──",
      "source_fingerprint": "24d9687291f2a582ac50d204f031656ca464a795ee406c284b99d963a18126cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
